text:
#GreyhoundFreedomWall6278

{Rant}

We used to be friends before, but now we don’t talk to each other anymore. It’s sad how things changed between us  we used to be so close, and now it feels like we’re just strangers. I don’t even know what happened or why things turned out this way, but sometimes people just drift apart, and that hurts the most. I thought I was already in the right circle of friends, but I guess I was wrong. Now, I only have one friend..... and it really hurts realizing that the people I trusted before weren’t meant to stay.
